{"ID":"20240220132601-qzngk8z","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132601-qzngk8z","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132601-qzngk8z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171812-j3qaw5c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171812-hzbpnvg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171812-hzbpnvg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:136,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:136\u0026#125;","title":"【四逆散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171812-j3qaw5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-j3qaw5c","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百三十二条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-aiwc2hj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-aiwc2hj","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，四逆，其人或咳，或悸，或小便不利，或腹中痛，或泄利下重者，「四逆散」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-du8jhid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-du8jhid","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"四逆散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-0bhchao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-0bhchao","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草炙。枳实破，水渍，炙干。柴胡。芍药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-0n49ajz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-0n49ajz","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，各十分，捣筛，白饮合服方寸匕，日三服。咳者，加五味子、干姜各五分，并主下利。悸者，加桂枝五分。小便不利者，加茯苓五分。腹中痛者，加附子一枚，炮令拆。泄利下重者，先以水五升，煮薤白三升，去滓，以散三方寸匕纳汤方，煮取一升半，分温再服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-wfii4gq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-wfii4gq","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方出现在这里很奇怪，因为四逆散跟四逆汤不太一样，它用炙甘草、枳实、柴胡跟芍药。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-m1p49hm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-m1p49hm","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡疏肝，枳实能够扩张管道"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，比如胆的管子太窄了，或者是大肠的管子太小了，燥矢在里面了，心脏血管太小了也可以用枳实，胸满的时候，张仲景都在用枳实。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"芍药止腹中痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-ejrkxx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-ejrkxx9","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个方子怎么会跑到少阴症来？心脏外面有心包，心包有一条脉络到胆囊上面，所以心脏在搏动，心包跟着心脏的速度来，所以胆汁出来的时候速度跟心脏搏动的速度相通，一阵一阵喷出来的。当你中焦寒湿很盛，会影响到胆囊，因为寒湿很盛，身体不消化，结果寒湿在外面，里面太干了，会造成这种结果。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-h5342i8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-h5342i8","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那所以四逆散在治"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"胆结石，胆发炎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"非常好用。胆结石胆堵到，痛的要死，肚子痛，手脚是冷的，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"处方去湿去热，没有什么去寒的药，增润一些津液在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-nrlwjb3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-nrlwjb3","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四逆散治疗最多的就是胆结石，除了可以加滑石，还可以加五倍子，海金沙。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五倍子是虫的壳，刚好结在树枝分叉的地方。海金沙结在树叶跟树枝分叉的地方，褐色咖啡色，就像胆的位置"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我们会用海金沙。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"四逆散症一般原因是胃寒引起的，原本是四逆汤症，随着里面寒湿累积，胆汁会越来越浓。还有一种原因是地域，东南沿海一带的人，他们吃吃醋比较多，大部分得到的是肾结石，用得到猪苓汤，用不到四逆散，因为吃醋胆清的比较干净。西边的人，吃的青盐居多，吃青盐没有肾结石，把肾结石都排掉了，大多得到的是胆结石，用得到四逆散，用不到猪苓汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-j9f1vjg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-j9f1vjg","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“咳者，加五味子、干姜各五分，并主下利。”这个方子为什么跑到这里来，有点疑问。中间可能少掉东西。平常张仲景的方子是几两几升，这里的几分不太合理。咳嗽加五味子干姜是很合理的。干姜温中，咳嗽是五味子。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-1v5p9e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-1v5p9e3","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“悸者，加桂枝五分。”心下悸是桂枝，脐下悸是茯苓甘草汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-gj5pzbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-gj5pzbk","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“小便不利者，加茯苓五分。”茯苓本来就是利尿的。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-44tjg97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-44tjg97","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“腹中痛者，加附子一枚，炮令拆。”为什么不用白芍，炮附子热把寒去掉，附子炮过以后把它打开来。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171812-hzbpnvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171812-hzbpnvg","updated":"20240312171812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"“泄利下重者，先以水五升，煮薤白三升，去滓，以散三方寸匕纳汤方，煮取一升半，分温再服。”薤白在胸牌篇会介绍到，薤白就是大蒜味，入肺。下痢很重的是时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"因为里面是热，才会用到柴胡，枳实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"薤白能宣肺"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，肺跟大肠是表里，因为他不是寒利，所以用薤白，一宣肺，汗一出来，利就止掉了。"}]}]}